                        ],
                        "form": "talismen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4965e960-2e64-3993-a5e7-958c64701a08",
                        "entry_id": "e265bbb4-ae1a-3af6-9b70-437761499586",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A magical object providing protection against ill will, or the supernatural, or conferring the wearer with a boon such as good luck, good health, or power(s)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "484e988f-42ec-4631-9940-50392cfa73d9",
                                "sense_id": "4965e960-2e64-3993-a5e7-958c64701a08",
                                "text": "That woman’s love is a talisman by which he holds and hopes to get his safety."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5330009-68c7-4365-84d6-44c923be95da",
                                "sense_id": "4965e960-2e64-3993-a5e7-958c64701a08",
                                "text": "I have in my possession three Magic Talismans, which I have ever guarded with utmost care, keeping the knowledge of their existence from anyone else."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea1954bc-2c73-4552-bc59-efd73fc658d6",
                                "sense_id": "4965e960-2e64-3993-a5e7-958c64701a08",
                                "text": "Dagobert gave him back his passport. He re-pocketed it indifferently; a talisman which had lost its potency."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35d4adc9-bdff-4c1c-bae9-669d87a97676",
                                "sense_id": "4965e960-2e64-3993-a5e7-958c64701a08",
                                "text": "She kept low, clutching the rifle she'd taken as though it were a magic talisman, as if it would somehow protect her even though she didn't fire it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "851e7958-4c99-4060-af66-1787e439b61a",
                                "sense_id": "4965e960-2e64-3993-a5e7-958c64701a08",
                                "text": "Mata would soon whip in the cross that allowed Drogba to equalise – and Chelsea went on to win the Champions League, beating the German club on penalties, with their talisman from the Ivory Coast making history with the final spot-kick."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea71eb19-b7bf-49a4-8ffd-a3e07623bf23",
                        "source_entry_id": "e265bbb4-ae1a-3af6-9b70-437761499586",
